mode: "100644"
text: "# The REACH framework — configure a TikTok VIDEO publish for reach + discovery + safe disclosure\n\nThe publish config is the **most controllable reach/SEO layer** of a TikTok video — the caption is search,\nduet/stitch are free distribution, the cover wins discovery, disclosure keeps you safe. REACH configures\nthe publish AND writes the search caption. **The video FILE is an input** (filmed by a human or made by the\nvideo skills); **WoopSocial publishes via `postType=VIDEO`** and auto-discloses AI on TikTok.\n\n## R — Rank the caption (caption = search)\n- **Lead-load the primary keyword** in the first ~100 chars (the actual topic, not a teaser), then a\n  value-prop line, then secondary keywords + **niche hashtags**. **Long-tail.** Mirror it in on-screen text.\n\n## E — Engage-open settings\n- Keep **`allowComment` / `allowDuet` / `allowStitch` ON** — duets/stitches are **free distribution**,\n  comments are the **engagement engine.** Restrict only for genuine brand-safety (know the reach cost).\n\n## A — Attract with the cover\n- Set a **clickable cover frame** — a legible **title card** that wins the **profile grid + search.**\n  WoopSocial sets the `cover` image as the video's **cover/thumbnail** (1080×1920, key text centred).\n\n## C — Confirm disclosure (truthfully)\n- **`isBrandedContent`** (third-party paid) / **`isYourBrand`** (own products) set **truthfully**; **#ad\n  up front.** AI content → WoopSocial **auto-discloses on TikTok**, but **prohibited AI uses** (fake\n  endorsements, unlabeled deepfakes of real people) **stay prohibited.** **Branded content can't be private.**\n\n## H — Handle mode + specs + validate\n- **`privacyLevel`** from platform-inputs; **`postMode`** `DIRECT_POST` vs **`MEDIA_UPLOAD`** (inbox →\n  add a trending sound natively). **1080×1920 9:16, MP4/MOV ≤1GB**, length to goal, cap from\n  `maxVideoPostDurationSec`. **Validate** before publish; **no update** → delete + recreate.\n\n## The publish brief a request should fill\n```\nINPUTS: the video file (external) + script/topic; brand-profile voice; the goal (reach/saves/shop)\nCAPTION: primary keyword first -> value-prop -> secondary keywords + niche hashtags; mirror in on-screen text\nSETTINGS: allowComment/allowDuet/allowStitch ON (unless brand-safety); privacyLevel from platform-inputs\nCOVER: the title-card image (cover/thumbnail, 1080x1920, centred)\nDISCLOSURE: isBrandedContent/isYourBrand truthful + #ad up front; AI auto-disclosed; prohibited AI stays out\nMODE + CHECK: DIRECT_POST or MEDIA_UPLOAD (trending sound); validate; no update -> delete+recreate; native analytics only\n```\n"
